+| Claim | Evidence | Result |
+|---|---|---|
+| `SPEC.closest-positive-lower` | `stage3/kprove-positive-lower.*` | `#Top`, 0 |
+| `SPEC.closest-positive-upper` | `stage3/kprove-positive-upper.*` | `#Top`, 0 |
